gametitle=Madden NFL 2004 (SLUS-20752) [14F8B841]
comment=WITHDRAWN -- refuted 2026-08-11. 0x001f6b0c's 30 is a STATE ID, not a duration. Do not deploy. Superseded by 14F8B841.dt-hold-90.pnach.

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// R6 (double-team persistence), candidate patch, UNVERIFIED.
//
// Measured baseline on slot 9 (I-Form HB lead dive vs a 3-4 nose), 3 runs,
// identical: double teams register at frame 2 and are ALL finished by frame 43
// of a 308-frame play. Per-player hold: RT 17 frames, TE 30, RG 13. The
// operator watching the screen described it as "a right guard briefly touch
// someone and then go to the second level", and episode-scoped pushback on the
// doubled DE was 0.410 yd -- fifteen inches.
//
// block-cycle.md describes a block as a "14-30-frame rigid two-body
// translation". 0x001f6b0c holds the ONLY immediate 30 in the block-cycle
// region 0x001F4000-0x001F7000, and 30 lands exactly on the observed maximum
// hold. That is the whole basis for this address.
//
//   001f6b0c  2402001e  addiu v0, zero, 30
//                    -> addiu v0, zero, 300   (0x012C)
//
// WHAT IS NOT ESTABLISHED: that this is the duration of the double-team hold
// rather than some other 30-frame timer sharing the region. The region also
// holds five immediate 20s. If the patch moves nothing, the constant is wrong,
// not the theory -- try the 20s next.
//
// Place field is 1 (apply every frame), not 0 (apply once at boot). That is
// deliberate: loading a savestate restores EE memory including this code word,
// so a boot-time patch would be silently reverted by the first `load_state`
// and every measurement would be of unpatched code.
//
// Test alone, never combined (CLAUDE.md rule 2). Acceptance, against the
// baseline above:
//   * dt_role == 2 persists past frame 43
//   * episode-scoped pushback on the doubled defender exceeds 15 inches
//   * operator sees a lineman driven backwards
// Regression surface: ordinary single-block line play must not change.
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

// WITHDRAWN: patch=1,EE,001f6b0c,extended,2402012c  (byte-wrote 44 over a state-id compare; see review-2026-08-11.md)
